+// Leaves room above the first page for a toolbar laid over the document: the
+// document starts below it and scrolls under it. Only the scroll view's inset
+// changes; the PDF view keeps its size, so its pages are not laid out again.
+// The inset counts from the top of the view, and iOS adds the safe area (the
